        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo BFD-2-630 Stainless Steel Deadbolt Strike Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nANSI deadbolt strike plate. Normally used on commercial metal frame doors for <a href=\"/collections/commercial-lock-sets\"><b>Commercial Deadbolt Locks</b></a>. Package includes stainless steel deadbolt strike plate with installation screws for use on either wood or metal doors and frames. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-BFD-2-630_size.gif?v=1704354689\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ANSI Stainless Steel Deadbolt Strike Plate Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Don-Jo BFD-2-630 Deadbolt Strike Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width to Lip: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Total Width: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Brushed Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Screws: #12-24 Flat Head Combo Screws (for wood or metal doors)</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BFD-2-630.pdf?v=1704262306\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo BFD-2-630 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
